                                                "sense_id": "8fcdf73d-1c45-3e7f-8050-cfd60429fd4e",
                                                "text": "In 1928, an arrangement was made between the Government of Northern Ireland and the N.C.C. for the construction of a loop line as an unemployment scheme."
